-programming/section-4-1-elsewhere-example","group":"Computer Programming"},"next":{"title":"Section 8.2: Time Matrix Multiply","url":"/sections/computer-programming/fortran/guide-to-fortran-2008-programming/section-8-2-time-matrix-multiply","group":"Computer Programming"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}